---
import RealtimeRoomLayout from "../../../../layouts/RealtimeRoomLayout.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "@siteConfig";
---
<RealtimeRoomLayout
  pageTitle={`夸克聊天室 - ${SITE_TITLE}`}
  bodyClass="quark-chat"
  systemTheme
  pageStyles={["/assets/pages/a/chat-room/chat.css"]}
  tailScripts={["/assets/js/user-profile.js", "/assets/js/firebase-ready.js", "/assets/pages/a/chat-room/chat.js"]}
>
  <div class="qc-layout">
    <aside class="qc-rail" id="chatRail">
      <nav class="qc-nav" aria-label="站点"><a href="/a/">实验室</a><a href="/blog/lyb/">留言板</a><button id="closeChatRail" class="qc-rail-close" type="button" aria-label="关闭房间列表">×</button></nav>
      <div class="qc-brand"><span aria-hidden="true" class="qc-mark"><i class="fas fa-comments"></i></span><h1>夸克聊天室</h1></div>
      <form id="roomForm" class="qc-room-form">
        <label for="roomInput">输入房间号</label>
        <div><input id="roomInput" required maxlength="64" autocomplete="off" placeholder="房间号或旧公开房间名" /><button class="qc-primary">加入</button></div>
        <button id="createRoom" class="qc-create" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true">＋</span> 创建房间</button>
      </form>
      <div class="qc-rooms"><h2>最近访问</h2><div id="roomList"></div></div>
      <div class="qc-rail-foot">
        <button id="profileButton" type="button">设置昵称</button>
        <span data-quark-bot-slot></span>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <main class="qc-main">
      <header class="qc-head">
        <button class="qc-mobile" type="button" id="mobileMenuBtn" aria-controls="chatRail" aria-expanded="true">房间</button>
        <div class="qc-heading"><h2 id="currentRoomTitle">聊天</h2><p id="connection" role="status">请选择房间</p></div>
        <div class="qc-head-actions" id="roomActions" hidden>
          <button type="button" id="searchChat">搜索</button>
          <button type="button" id="roomTasks">待办</button>
          <button type="button" id="copyRoomCode">复制房号</button>
          <button type="button" id="shareRoom">分享链接</button>
          <button type="button" id="notifications" aria-label="开启桌面通知"><i class="far fa-bell" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        </div>
      </header>
      <section class="qc-stream" id="messagesContainer" aria-label="聊天记录" tabindex="0">
        <div class="qc-empty" id="chatEmpty">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="qc-mark"><i class="fas fa-comment-dots"></i></span>
          <h2>开始一场聊天</h2><p>创建限时房间，或使用朋友分享的房间号加入。</p>
          <p>旧房间名仍可用于进入公开聊天。</p>
        </div>
        <button class="qc-history" type="button" id="moreHistory" hidden>加载更早消息</button>
        <ol class="qc-list" id="messagesList"></ol>
      </section>
      <div class="qc-jump" id="jumpBar" hidden>
        <button type="button" id="jumpUnread">回到上次阅读处</button>
        <button type="button" id="jumpLatest">回到最新消息</button>
      </div>
      <form class="qc-compose" id="messageForm" hidden>
        <div class="qc-context" id="replyContext" hidden><span id="replyText"></span><button type="button" id="clearReply" aria-label="取消引用">×</button></div>
        <div class="qc-context" id="imageContext" hidden><img id="imagePreview" alt="待发送的图片" /><span id="imageLabel"></span><button type="button" id="clearImage" aria-label="移除图片">×</button></div>
        <label for="messageInput" class="qc-sr">输入消息</label>
        <textarea id="messageInput" rows="2" maxlength="2400" placeholder="写消息…"></textarea>
        <div class="qc-compose-foot">
          <div class="qc-tools">
            <button type="button" id="attachImage"><span aria-hidden="true">▧</span> 图片</button>
            <input id="imageFile" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp,image/gif,image/avif" hidden />
            <button type="button" id="addTask"><span aria-hidden="true">☑</span> 待办</button>
          </div>
          <span class="qc-keyhint">Enter 发送 · Shift + Enter 换行</span>
          <button id="sendMessage" type="submit" class="qc-primary">发送</button>
        </div>
      </form>
      <p id="chatFeedback" class="qc-feedback" role="status" hidden></p>
    </main>
  </div>
  <dialog class="qc-dialog" id="profileDialog">
    <form id="profileForm">
      <h2>聊天身份</h2>
      <label for="nicknameInput">昵称</label>
      <input id="nicknameInput" required maxlength="32" autocomplete="nickname" />
      <label for="profileColor">头像颜色</label>
      <input id="profileColor" type="color" value="#5874dd" />
      <div class="qc-dialog-actions"><button type="button" data-close="profileDialog">取消</button><a id="accountProfileLink" href="/auth" hidden>管理博客身份</a><button id="profileSave" class="qc-primary" type="submit">保存</button></div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="qc-dialog" id="searchChatDialog" aria-labelledby="searchChatHeading">
    <form method="dialog">
      <h2 id="searchChatHeading">搜索消息</h2>
      <input type="search" id="searchChatInput" placeholder="消息内容、昵称或待办" aria-label="搜索已加载消息" autocomplete="off" />
      <p id="searchChatStatus" role="status"></p>
      <ul class="qc-search-list" id="searchChatResults"></ul>
      <div class="qc-dialog-actions"><button>关闭</button></div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="qc-dialog" id="roomTasksDialog" aria-labelledby="roomTasksHeading">
    <h2 id="roomTasksHeading">未完成待办</h2>
    <p>显示已加载消息里的待办，点选可跳到对应消息。</p>
    <ul id="roomTasksList" class="qc-task-list"></ul>
    <div class="qc-dialog-actions"><button type="button" data-close="roomTasksDialog">关闭</button></div>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="qc-dialog" id="createDialog">
    <form id="createForm">
      <h2>创建聊天房间</h2>
      <label for="createTitle">房间名称</label>
      <input id="createTitle" required maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：周五讨论" />
      <label for="createPassword">加入口令（可选）</label>
      <input id="createPassword" type="password" minlength="8" maxlength="80" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="至少 8 个字符" />
      <label for="createRetention">房间开放时间</label>
      <select id="createRetention"><option value="1">1 小时</option><option value="24" selected>24 小时</option><option value="168">7 天</option></select>
      <p>房间到期后无法再打开聊天记录。邀请链接只含随机房间号，口令请单独分享。</p>
      <p id="createError" role="status" class="qc-form-error"></p>
      <div class="qc-dialog-actions"><button type="button" data-close="createDialog">取消</button><button class="qc-primary" type="submit">创建</button></div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="qc-dialog" id="accessDialog">
    <form id="accessForm">
      <h2>输入房间口令</h2>
      <input id="accessCode" type="hidden" />
      <label for="accessPassword">房间口令</label>
      <input id="accessPassword" type="password" maxlength="80" autocomplete="current-password" required />
      <p id="accessError" role="status" class="qc-form-error"></p>
      <div class="qc-dialog-actions"><button type="button" data-close="accessDialog">取消</button><button class="qc-primary" type="submit">加入</button></div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="qc-dialog" id="taskDialog">
    <form id="taskForm">
      <h2>发起待办</h2>
      <p>房间里的成员可以直接完成或重新打开这项待办。</p>
      <label for="taskInput">事项</label>
      <input id="taskInput" required maxlength="160" placeholder="例如：发出会议纪要" />
      <div class="qc-dialog-actions"><button type="button" data-close="taskDialog">取消</button><button class="qc-primary" type="submit">添加到消息</button></div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="qc-dialog qc-image-dialog" id="imageDialog">
    <button type="button" data-close="imageDialog">关闭</button><img id="expandedImage" alt="聊天图片预览" />
  </dialog>
</RealtimeRoomLayout>
